{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreaderui\/advertisements"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreaderui\/advertisements"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"By default the PSReaderUI SDK does not display any advertisements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Advertisement support is opt-in through the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Implement this delegate to provide view controllers that the SDK embeds as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"banner ads within the reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Protocol Methods","anchor":"Protocol-Methods","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate","type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol defines three methods, each returning an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"optional ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertViewController","type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate\/advertViewControllerForBottomBanner(inPublished:edition:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— bottom banner in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"feed edition"}]},{"type":"text","text":" readers."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate\/advertViewControllerForBottomBanner(inReplicaEdition:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— bottom banner in "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"replica edition"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" readers."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate\/advertViewControllerForTopBanner(inReplicaEdition:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— top banner in ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"replica edition"}]},{"text":" readers.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" from any method to omit the ad placement for that context."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Feed editions support bottom banners only. Replica editions support","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both top and bottom banners.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"level":2,"text":"Creating an AdvertViewController","anchor":"Creating-an-AdvertViewController","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your ad view controller must conform to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". The SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"embeds it as a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"child view controller"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" within the reader interface — it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"added via ","type":"text"},{"code":"addChild","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and its view is placed inside the reader’s view hierarchy.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This means your ad banner participates in the standard UIKit containment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lifecycle (","type":"text"},{"code":"willMove(toParent:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"didMove(toParent:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", etc.).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import PSReaderUI","import PSReader","","class MyAdBanner: UIViewController, PSReaderUI.AdvertViewController {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        \/\/ Load and display your ad content","    }","","    func didChangeTo(spread: PSEPageSpread?,","                     inEdition edition: PSEEdition,","                     inPublished published: PSEPublished) {","        refreshAd()","    }","","    func didChangeTo(spread: PSReplicaPageSpread?,","                     inReplicaEdition replicaEdition: PSReplicaEdition) {","        refreshAd()","    }","","    private func refreshAd(forPage pageNumber: Int) {","        \/\/ Refresh your ad or update section targeting","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The banner’s height is determined by your view’s Auto Layout constraints. Set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an intrinsic content size or explicit height constraint on your ad view to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"control how tall the banner appears in the reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Assigning the Delegate","anchor":"Assigning-the-Delegate","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set the delegate on your ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/GlobalConfiguration"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct MyAdvertDelegate: PSReaderUI.AdvertDelegate {","    func advertViewControllerForBottomBanner(","        inPublished published: PSEPublished,","        edition: PSEEdition","    ) -> AdvertViewController? {","        return MyAdBanner()","    }","","    func advertViewControllerForBottomBanner(","        inReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> AdvertViewController? {","        return MyAdBanner()","    }","","    func advertViewControllerForTopBanner(","        inReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> AdvertViewController? {","        return nil \/\/ No top banner","    }","}","","globalConfig.advertDelegate = MyAdvertDelegate()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delegate is inherited by all reader configurations created from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"global configuration."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Responding to Page Changes","anchor":"Responding-to-Page-Changes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK notifies your "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the reader’s visible page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes. This is useful for refreshing ad content or updating section-level"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ad targeting as the user navigates through an edition."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" defines two page change callbacks — one for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edition type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertViewController\/didChangeTo(spread:inEdition:inPublished:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— called in ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"feed edition"}]},{"text":" readers.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertViewController\/didChangeTo(spread:inReplicaEdition:)","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— called in ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"replica edition"}]},{"text":" readers.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both methods receive the current page spread and edition context. The "},{"code":"spread","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter is "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when there is no active page (for example, during a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition). Use "},{"code":"referencePage()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the spread to get the primary page:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["func didChangeTo(spread: PSEPageSpread?,","                 inEdition edition: PSEEdition,","                 inPublished published: PSEPublished) {","    guard let page = spread?.referencePage() else { return }","    \/\/ Use page.pageNumber for ad targeting or to trigger an ad refresh","    adView.setTargeting(page: page.pageNumber)","    adView.loadNewAd()","}","","func didChangeTo(spread: PSReplicaPageSpread?,","                 inReplicaEdition replicaEdition: PSReplicaEdition) {","    guard let page = spread?.referencePage() else { return }","    \/\/ Use page.num for the page number in replica editions","    adView.setTargeting(page: page.num)","    adView.loadNewAd()","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both methods have default implementations that do nothing, so you only need to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implement the ones relevant to your ad setup. If you only serve ads in feed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editions, you can omit the replica variant and vice versa.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PSReaderUI"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Advertisements"},"abstract":[{"text":"Display custom advertisements within the reader.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Advertisements"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Features","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Deep-Linking","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Paywall-Integration","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Sharing","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Commenting","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Text-to-Speech","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Media-Playback","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Analytics","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Search"],"anchor":"Features","generated":true}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI/Analytics":{"kind":"article","title":"Analytics","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Analytics","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track user interactions and content engagement across the PSReaderUI SDK."}],"url":"\/documentation\/psreaderui\/analytics","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI/documentation/PSReaderUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI","title":"PSReaderUI","abstract":[{"typ